I am proud to have the support of Giffords PAC and Former Congresswoman Gabrielle Giffords.

“Americans are sick and tired of worrying about gun violence while walking through their neighborhood, shopping for groceries, or dropping their kids off at school. It’s time for change. This November, we must elect leaders who are unafraid to fight for safer communities. That’s why I’m proud to endorse Congresswoman April Delaney as she runs to represent the voices of Marylanders in Congress. Congresswoman Delaney prioritizes the safety of our children and families, and she has the voting record to prove it. She has been unafraid to oppose the gun lobby, and I know that with her in office for another two years Marylanders will be safer.” - Gabrielle Giffords

@GabbyGiffords @GIFFORDS_org

